  "details": "If you look closely in \"Report a Group\" article in Help & Info, the photo of Very Reportable Group which appears there is predating the [VRChat 2025.4.2](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202542) release from December 3, 2025, which added a feature to share groups.\n\n1. Open Main Menu.\n\n2. Click the \"?\" icon top right for Help & Info.\n\n3. Navigate to Safety group on the left.\n\n4. Click \"Report a Group\" and scroll down to find a photo of Very Reportable Group without the Share icon.\n\n5. Search the group (RATTT.4926) in-app and compare to the current design of the group page.",
